---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const SPOND_INVITE_URL = 'https://spond.com/invite/FVTCD';
const SPOND_GROUP_CODE = 'FVTCD';
---

<Base title="Join us" description="How to join First & Last Pickleball Club via Spond — on the app, on the web, or by old-fashioned email.">
  <section>
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Three steps</p>
      <h1>Joining the club</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        We manage all of our sessions through <strong>Spond</strong> — used by sports clubs across
        Europe. Once you're in our group, you can see upcoming sessions, book a place, and pay any
        session fee in one tap. <strong>Spond works on both phone and web</strong> — pick whichever
        suits.
      </p>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <span class="num">1</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Get Spond</h3>
            <p>Two options — same account works on both.</p>
            <div class="option-grid">
              <div class="option">
                <strong>On your phone</strong>
                <p>
                  Free from
                  <a href="https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/spond/id1015425229" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the App Store</a>
                  or
                  <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.spond.spond" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Play</a>.
                  Best for booking on the move and getting session reminders.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="option">
                <strong>In a web browser</strong>
                <p>
                  Go to
                  <a href="https://spond.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">spond.com</a>
                  and click <em>Sign up</em>. Works on a laptop or desktop — no install needed.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span class="num">2</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Join our group</h3>
            <p>You'll need our group code:</p>
            <p class="group-code">{SPOND_GROUP_CODE}</p>
            <p>Enter it when prompted after signing up — in the app or on spond.com. We'll approve you within a day or so.</p>
            <p class="or">— or —</p>
            <p>
              <a href={SPOND_INVITE_URL} class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the invite link</a>
            </p>
            <p class="hint">
              The invite link is designed for phones and will prompt you to install the app. If
              you're on a laptop, sign up at <a href="https://spond.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">spond.com</a>
              and enter the group code above instead.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span class="num">3</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Book a session and come along</h3>
            <p>
              Browse the upcoming sessions, tap or click <em>I'm in</em>, and turn up. First-timers
              should aim for Sunday morning — easy hitting, beginners encouraged, paddles to borrow.
            </p>
            <p><a href="/sessions">See session times →</a></p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="faq">
        <h2>A few common questions</h2>

        <details>
          <summary>I don't want to use an app or website</summary>
          <p>
            That's fine. Email us at
            <a href="mailto:hello@firstandlastpickleball.co.uk">hello@firstandlastpickleball.co.uk</a>
            and an admin can add you to the group manually with your email address. You won't get
            phone notifications but you'll get session updates by email.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>I've never played pickleball — is that ok?</summary>
          <p>
            Absolutely. Sunday morning is the best time to come — bring trainers and a drink, we've got
            paddles and balls you can borrow. Most people are rallying within their first session.
            If you want a head start, we've got <a href="/rules">pickleball in 5 minutes</a> — enough
            to walk onto a court knowing the rules.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>What does it cost?</summary>
          <p>
            Session fees are shown on Spond when you book. We keep them as low as we can — they cover
            court hire at GO! St Just.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Can I just turn up?</summary>
          <p>
            We'd rather you booked through Spond — it helps us know numbers and balance the courts.
            If you've genuinely just walked in off the street, come and say hi anyway.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details>
          <summary>Do I need my own kit?</summary>
          <p>
            Not at first. We have club paddles to borrow. Once you're hooked (and you will be) most
            members pick up their own paddle for £30–£100 depending on level.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 48rem; }
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .steps li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 14px;
  }
  .num {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--sea-dark);
    color: var(--sand);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .steps h3 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }

  .option-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .option-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .option {
    background: var(--sand);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
  }
  .option strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--sea-dark);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .option p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }

  .group-code {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--sea-dark);
    color: var(--sand);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem;
    user-select: all;
  }
  .or {
    color: var(--sea-light);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.75rem;
    max-width: 12rem;
  }
  .hint { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--slate); margin-top: 0.75rem; }

  .faq { margin-top: 3rem; }
  .faq h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  details {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }
  details summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sea-dark);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  details summary::after {
    content: '+';
    color: var(--coral);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  details[open] summary::after { content: '−'; }
  details p { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
</style>
